It is late at night.
The summer sky is not black, but glows deep blue.
I get ready for bed and put my things away.
At the window, I look outside one more time.
I think back on the whole time since January.
My arrival in the winter was very cold.
I did not have a winter coat yet in the beginning.
Then I took care of the registration and had my first day at the office.
In spring, I found the badminton club.
After all these exciting things, my summer birthday today was completely normal.
But this city is now my city.
I had a wonderful birthday today.
The evening was exactly what I wanted.
I am completely present in the moment and simply happy.
It is nice to be thirty-two years old now.
